  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "cell_index": 1,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "缩聚",
      "text_sha256": "92C5424F092CEB53F93D00D6614FCEE0A7D46C0626BC1E2BF1F11827BE36A985",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[1]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 1,
      "kind": "code",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "style": "code",
      "text": "index1 = [1,2,7,8,9];\nindex2 = [3,4,5,6,7,8,9];\nK2 = KR_cb;\nK2(index1,index1) = KR_cb(index1,index1)-KP_cb;\nK2(index2,index2) = KR_cb(index2,index2)-KN_cb;\nC2 = CR_cb;\nC2(index1,index1) = CR_cb(index1,index1)-CP_cb;\nC2(index2,index2) = CR_cb(index2,index2)-CN_cb;\nC1 = CR_cb-C2;\nK1 = KR_cb-K2;\n\n\ndt = 1/1024;\nal = (4*MR_cb+2*dt*CR_cb+dt^2*KR_cb)\\MR_cb*4;\nal = diag(diag(al));",
      "text_sha256": "F4432D198643C713C0115BA67057F8939FD8CCAA1BAECC356262CB0904CD0801",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[2]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 2,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "\\frac{X\\left(z\\right)}{F\\left(z\\right)}=\\frac{1}{\\frac{{\\left(z-1\\right)}^2 }{\\alpha z\\Delta t^2 }M+\\frac{z-1}{z\\Delta t}C_1 +{\\mathrm{K}}_1 +z^{-j} \\left(\\frac{z-1}{z\\Delta t}C_2 +{\\mathrm{K}}_2 \\right)}",
      "text_sha256": "1D75124C33541F352B7F523ECDFFC4619B9537F85C02CFBD152AFC174D7F9A11",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[3]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 3,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "按照上述公式计算传递函数",
      "text_sha256": "2DE48E6C7EBCE8E9674178E8867BE5525F78B1C131C4D607603034B85BBF28A2",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[4]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 2,
      "kind": "code",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "style": "code",
      "text": "% 2. 选择矩阵 S: 6x15\nS = zeros(2, 9);\n\n% 定义映射：小矩阵第1-3行 → 大矩阵第1-3行\n% 小矩阵第4-6行 → 大矩阵第6-8行\nrow_map = [1 2];\n\nfor i = 1:2\n    S(i, row_map(i)) = 1;\nend\n\n%    for j = 1:30",
      "text_sha256": "2CE7F0544A0F8FF37CF9F5AA00798419D18CC38998286480171E94057C952169",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[5]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 4,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "这里不采用之前的阻尼矩阵进行缩聚，而是采用使用缩聚后的刚度和阻尼矩阵求出新的阻尼",
      "text_sha256": "6EDAA2DC4559EC4FCC9D9296D5FF2E8391A46BB187D4F7607A57B92558D3E4FE",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[6]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 5,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "实际测试表明两者没有区别，虽然矩阵数值上存在差距，但是稳定域没差别",
      "text_sha256": "E2B5ACE1F26382F8215930B73F8CC7B98C97E3976E40E3E99FFEAC3B30969DF1",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[7]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 6,
      "kind": "text",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "style": "text",
      "text": "定义循环，求解稳定域",
      "text_sha256": "1F02EA3680ADE6C074E485CF9E12A8E6A0372679B1ED9B1F154F0AD4D2AC46E5",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[8]"
    },
    {
      "cell_index": 3,
      "kind": "code",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "style": "code",
      "text": "stab = zeros(20);\nfor l = 0:15\n%l =5;\n%for j = 0:15\n%j = 25;\nj = 0;\n%j = 0;\n%z=tf('z',dt);\nsyms z\n%l = 19;\n%j = 5;\nH = sym(eye(9,9));\nH(1,1) = z^(-l);\nH(2,2) = z^(-j);\n\n%syms z\nG = (z-1)^2/z/dt^2*MR_cb/al+(z-1)/z/dt*C1+K1+...\n    ((z-1)/z/dt*C2+K2)*H+S'*DeltaG*S;\n%G = (z-1)^2/z/dt^2*MNren/al+(z-1)/z/dt*CNren+KNren+...\n%    S'*H*((z-1)/z/dt*CPren+KPren+(z-1)/z/dt*Kd_ctrl+Kp_ctrl)*S;\ndet_G = det(G);\nGcls_zero = vpa(solve(det_G == 0, z));\ns = max(abs(Gcls_zero))\nstab(l+1,j+1) = s;\nend\n%end\n",
      "text_sha256": "120FA3FCED6E033AAD6AC29E9D10C9DED92E1226C24ADFE2F137D72F6EE08CE3",
      "xml_xpath": "/w:document/w:body/w:p[9]"
    }
  ],
  "source_name": "luxvjie_cb_LQR2.mlx",
